  "real_vs_stub": {
    "real": "110600-110603 (Etc0l1-l4), 110609-110612 (Etc0g1-g4), 110618-110621 (Etc0u1-u4), 110670 (Etc2g6). Evidence per quest: full handwritten Lua (grading in md), parity-CSV client scenario reference with matching delegate sets (sizes 2749-3491 bytes), all actor IDs present in gamedata_actor_class.sql, single sequence-gated CompleteQuest, colon-form calls. Availability still labels them Implemented (0l/0g/0u x4) / Partially implemented (2g6) but commented out (disabled).",
    "scaffold_stub": "50 codes with exact-name 3-line InitQuestScaffold files + noOffer=true scaffold rows (lines 48-97). Parity CSV status missing/missing_local_script_gamedata_present with zero recovered events.",
    "missing_script": "32 codes with no etc/<code>.lua file and no scaffold row (Etc1l2/1l4, Etc2l2/2l4/2l6-2l9, Etc1g3/1g7, Etc2g7-2g9, Etc1u3, Etc2u3/2u4/2u6-2u9, Etc1i4-1i9, Etc2i3, Etc3i4-3i6, Etc5u2/5u3). SQL + DAT rows exist; no runtime script, no offer path, no crash path.",
    "etc1i1_note": "Parity CSV references a client etc1i1.lua shell with a single empty processEvent020; client source no longer in-repo; local file is the noOffer scaffold. Classified stub with explicit shell-only trace note, not an implementation."
  },
  "engine_verification": {
    "offer_gating": "all 95 IDs commented out in quest_availability.lua side_quests.patch_unknown_or_internal (lines 585-679); scaffold isEligible additionally returns false on noOffer (generic_quest_scaffold.lua:266-267); missing-script codes have no handlers at all",
    "reward_path": "completeScaffold unreachable for stubs (isEligible false at onStart:348, onStateChange:358, advanceScaffold:321, journal:379, markers:388); real quests grant only their Lua-coded items (Etc2g6 shards/juice) and never touch SQL filler rows directly",
    "removeitem_safety": "Etc2g6 RemoveItem(id,4) is guarded by HasItem(id,4) quantity check (ItemPackage.cs:441 via Character.cs:4286-4298): short counts no-op safely, no crash or dupe path"
  },
