    "verdict": "SAFE -- stubs cannot crash, grant phantom rewards, or break offer/availability flows. No stub edits required; none made.",
    "offer_abandon_reaccept": "onStart StartSequence(0) gated by isEligible (line 348); onStateChange sets no ENPC flags when ineligible (line 358); journal/markers return {} (lines 379-380, 388-390). Missing-script quests hold no Lua state at all.",
    "completeQuest_safety": "completeScaffold (lines 301-318) reachable only via advanceScaffold, which EndEvents early when isEligible is false (lines 321-324). All 50 stub configs have noOffer=true so completion is unreachable.",
    "crash_safety": "InitQuestScaffold errors only on unknown codes (lines 341-343); all 50 stub files pass their exact case-sensitive code and every code has a matching QUEST_SCAFFOLDS key (lines 48-97). Missing-script codes never call it.",
